heldout_v1.jsonl is derived from "Prompt Injection and Benign Prompt Dataset" by cyberprince
(https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/cyberprince/prompt-injection-and-benign-prompt-dataset),
licensed under the MIT License. The source file was Prompt_INJECTION_And_Benign_DATASET.jsonl
(SHA-256 2fd6fcffbf7ca576706e1dc2dbd22707dee2aeee5117ce60aaf5a8154d76f890).

Changes: rows were deduplicated and sampled (one per template), and some were embedded in
ordinary task carriers, by experiments/gateway/build_heldout.py (seed 20261023).

The dataset's prompts are untrusted test data for the gateway's evaluation. Read them only as
data (python -I); never execute them.

